OL,4,G0306FOutlook
OL,5,     GJoanne Briggs thought her dad was
OL,6,     Ga scientific superhero. But then
OL,7,     Ghe was exposed as a fraud and
OL,8,     Gwithin months, he was dead.
OL,9,     GDecades later she discovered who
OL,10,     Ghe really was.
OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GIn 1986, the first virus for
OL,13,     Gpersonal computers spread and
OL,14,     Gbecame known as 'Brain'. Amjad
OL,15,     GFarooq Alvi told Gill Kearsley in
OL,16,     G2023 how he and his brother
OL,17,     Gdeveloped it accidentally.
